## SQ-LGM-05 | knife kills drop racks of mutton (sheep at 190)
@group A
@commands Summon 20 sheep, bot kills each with a knife in the main hand; again burning; again with a stone sword
@pass about half drop a Raw Rack of Mutton; burning ones the Cooked Rack; none with the sword (LGM-05, 06)
@fails loot modifier (`data/forge/loot_modifiers`)
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> zact kill 190 -60 500 minecraft:sheep 20 farmersdelight:iron_knife
> zact kill 190 -60 500 minecraft:sheep 20 farmersdelight:iron_knife fire
> zact kill 190 -60 500 minecraft:sheep 20 minecraft:stone_sword
expect \[zact\] kill minecraft:sheep x20 held farmersdelight:iron_knife dead 20: .*largemeals:raw_mutton_rack x([5-9]|1[0-5])\b
expect \[zact\] kill minecraft:sheep x20 held farmersdelight:iron_knife fire dead 20: .*largemeals:cooked_mutton_rack x([5-9]|1[0-5])\b
expect \[zact\] kill minecraft:sheep x20 held minecraft:stone_sword dead 20: (?!.*mutton_rack)
look about half of each knife batch drops a rack; the burning batch has no raw rack

